# SHARED GATE / seven simultaneous tones, one ten-second pan/filter gesture.
# '10 supplies the missing gates; explicit note gates keep priority.
{s100 s200 s300 s400 s500 s700 s800}p1>-1f5>3'10
# {s100'2 2s200 s300'3}p1>-1f5>3'10  # gates: 2, 8 and 3 seconds
# Rhythmic sequences, finite-repeat clocks and feedback excitations keep their own gates.
